/// Repository-local control planes consumed by coding assistants, rather than
/// product inputs owned by a ticket. These are exact project-root prefixes:
/// a product directory named `.codex` below `src/`, for example, is not
/// excluded. Compatibility directories commonly contain symlinks back to the
/// authoritative `.agents` tree; excluding the aliases keeps read-scope
/// inventory fail-closed for ordinary product symlinks without rejecting a
/// repository merely because it supports multiple agent clients.
const AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_PREFIXES: [&str; 3] = [".codex", ".claude", ".opencode"];

